@startuml
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam style strictuml

class CSimulation
class CRender
class CMap
class CLoopReader
class CRobot
class CWallFollower
class CWheel
class CRangeSensor
class CTrail

CRobot <|-- CWallFollower

'Each update advances the simulation 
'by a fixed amount of simulated time.
CSimulation *-- CRender
CSimulation *-- CMap

'Each time the robot collides with a wall, 
'the collision is reported to the console.
CSimulation *-- CWallFollower

'The robot is driven by two independently 
'controlled wheels, one either side.
CRobot "1" *-- "2" CWheel

'The robot carries exactly two range sensors
CRobot "1" *-- "2" CRangeSensor

'The robot leaves a trail behind it showing its trajectory, 
'and the trail remains visible for the whole run.
CRobot *-- CTrail

CMap..> CLoopReader
CWallFollower ..> CMap
CRangeSensor ..> CMap
CRobot ..> CRender
CMap ..> CRender
CTrail ..> CRender

@enduml